    "chunk_text": "for\u00fe gel\u00e6ded to sleanne. \u00dea b\u00e6d he self \u00fe\u00e6t hiene mon \u00e6r gefulwade, & \u00fea he gefulwad w\u00e6s, he w\u00e6s \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6s On \u00f0\u00e6m dagum Gratianus gefeaht on Gallium wi\u00f0 Alomonne \u00fe\u00e6m folce, & heora fela M On \u00fe\u00e6m \u00f0riddan geare his rices, \u00fea he \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6ste woh dyde wi\u00f0 \u00fea Godes \u00feeowas, \u00fea adrifon \u00dea oferhogode he \u00fe\u00e6t he him a\u00f0er dyde, o\u00fe\u00fee wiernde, o\u00fe\u00fee tig\u00feade, ac hie let sittan \u00fe\u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6r hie Ac his gerefan & his ealdormen nieddon hi \u00e6fter gafole, & micel geflit h\u00e6fdon ymb \u00fe\u00e6t, o\u00fe \u00fea \u00dea Ualens \u00fe\u00e6t geacsade on Antiochia \u00fe\u00e6re byrig, \u00fea wear\u00f0 he swi\u00fee sarig, & ge\u00feohte his On \u00fe\u00e6m feor\u00fean geare his rices he gefeaht wi\u00fe Gotan, & gefliemed wear\u00f0, & bedrifen on anne \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s swi\u00fee ryht dom geendad \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00feone woroldlice forb\u00e6rndon \u00fee hie \u00feohte b\u00e6rnan on \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & C & XXXIII, feng Gratianus to Romana Ac Theodosius genam fri\u00fe wi\u00f0 hie, & on \u00fe\u00e6re sibbe he l\u00e6dde Athanaricus hiora cyning mid Ra\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee Gotan angeaton hu god Theodosius w\u00e6s, \u00e6g\u00feer ge hie, ge ealle \u00fea \u00feeoda \u00fee on On \u00fe\u00e6m dagum gecuron Brettanie Maximianus him to casere ofer his willan. Se w\u00e6re wier\u00f0",
